# Post-change validation

After substantive TypeScript or JavaScript changes, run the available commands in order:

```bash
npm run lint
npm run typecheck
npm run test
npm run build
```

If a script does not exist because `FND-001` has not added it yet, report that fact and run the remaining commands. Fix failures introduced by the change. Never hide failures with ignore comments or flags.

For documentation/rule-only changes, validate Markdown links, formatting, and `git diff --check`; full application checks are optional unless configuration changed.
